OL,3,CCould you be fined #1,000 for filling
OL,4,Cup your paddling pool?
OL,6,FLast week, the Environment Agency
OL,7,Fdeclared around half of England in
OL,8,Fdrought, following a bout of record-
OL,9,Fbreaking heatwaves and low rainfall.
OL,11,FMeanwhile, the UK Health Security
OL,12,FAgency (UKHSA) has amber heat health
OL,13,Falerts in place for the East Midlands,
OL,14,FEast of England, South East and London
OL,15,Funtil Wednesday morning, as the Met
OL,16,FOffice says temperatures could soar to
OL,17,F35C on Monday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
