OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785779366
OL,3,CCould you be fined #1,000 for filling
OL,4,Cup your paddling pool?
OL,6,FAccording of Ofwat, if you are living
OL,7,Funder a hosepipe ban, you cannot use a
OL,8,Fhosepipe for activities such as
OL,9,Fwatering your garden, filling a
OL,10,Fpaddling pool, or washing your car.
OL,12,FIn many cases, you can still do these
OL,13,Fthings, but will need to use a
OL,14,Fwatering can or bucket instead.
OL,16,FThe rules are laid out under the Water
OL,17,FIndustry Act 1991, although specific
OL,18,Frestrictions vary depending on the
OL,19,Fwater company.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
