OL,3,CCould you be fined #1,000 for filling
OL,4,Cup your paddling pool?
OL,6,FWho enforces a ban, and how much could
OL,7,FI be fined for breaking it?
OL,9,FIn the UK, you could face a fine of up
OL,10,Fto #1,000 for going against the rules,
OL,11,Fwhich are enforced by the water
OL,12,Fcompanies.
OL,14,FMost providers have an online system
OL,15,Fallowing people to report their
OL,16,Fneighbours for breaking restrictions.
OL,18,FBut many companies, such as Southern
OL,19,FWater, also say they aim to "educate
OL,20,Ffirst", only taking action in "serious
OL,21,For repeated cases".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
