PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785779366
OL,3,CCould you be fined #1,000 for filling
OL,4,Cup your paddling pool?
OL,6,FSimilarly, South East Water say that
OL,7,F"prosecution is very much a last
OL,8,Fresort".
OL,10,FOthers, such as Cambridge Water, even
OL,11,Fexplicitly ask people not to contact
OL,12,Fthem regarding tip-offs.
OL,14,FWho is exempt from areas with a
OL,15,Fhosepipe ban?
OL,17,FPeople who are registered disabled,
OL,18,Fblue badge holders or those on a water
OL,19,Fcompany's priority services register
OL,20,Fare among the exemptions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
