OL,3,CCould you be fined #1,000 for filling
OL,4,Cup your paddling pool?
OL,6,FFor specific guidance in your area,
OL,7,Fyou should visit your water company's
OL,8,Fwebsite.
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FAre people following the rules?
OL,17,FMore than one in 10 householders who
OL,18,Fare currently living with a hosepipe
OL,19,Fban do not intend to abide by it,
OL,20,Faccording to a YouGov poll.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785779366
OL,3,CCould you be fined #1,000 for filling
OL,4,Cup your paddling pool?
OL,6,FSome 11% of households said they did
OL,7,Fnot intend to fully abide by the ban `
OL,8,Fwhile 5% said they did not yet know,
OL,9,Fthe recent survey of more than 4,200
OL,10,Fadults found.
OL,12,FOverall, just half of households (49%)
OL,13,Fsaid they supported a hosepipe ban in
OL,14,Ftheir local area, while 35% said they
OL,15,Fopposed the restrictions.
OL,17,FA significant number of responses from
OL,18,Fthose polled involved the belief that
OL,19,Fthose on a meter should be able to use
OL,20,Fas much water as they needed because
OL,21,Fthey were paying for it.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
